{"id":"wb-5-139","name":"七个星佛寺遗址","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"七个星佛寺遗址","text":"七个星佛寺遗址也叫锡格沁明屋遗址是位于新疆维吾尔自治区巴音郭楞蒙古自治州焉耆回族自治县始建于晋代的一处佛教遗存，也是焉耆国中最大的一处佛教遗址。是新疆仅存的同时保有佛塔、佛殿、石窟和僧房生活区的珍贵遗址群。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E4%B8%83%E4%B8%AA%E6%98%9F%E4%BD%9B%E5%AF%BA%E9%81%97%E5%9D%80","revisionId":94921585,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=94921585","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/50884b366fef2a851d90fa87.jpg","title":"七颗星遗址出土的菩萨泥塑头像.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E4%B8%83%E9%A2%97%E6%98%9F%E9%81%97%E5%9D%80%E5%87%BA%E5%9C%9F%E7%9A%84%E8%8F%A9%E8%90%A8%E6%B3%A5%E5%A1%91%E5%A4%B4%E5%83%8F.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/9a/%E4%B8%83%E9%A2%97%E6%98%9F%E9%81%97%E5%9D%80%E5%87%BA%E5%9C%9F%E7%9A%84%E8%8F%A9%E8%90%A8%E6%B3%A5%E5%A1%91%E5%A4%B4%E5%83%8F.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"HaziiDozen","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​七颗星遗址出土的菩萨泥塑头像 现藏于新疆维吾尔自治区博物馆","width":320,"height":285}}